<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fauchard Fork</h1>
<p>Average Length: Approx. 3-5 feet
Type of Weapon: Distanced Hand-to-hand.
</p><p>There were two general forms of this combination weapon. The first followed the typical Fauchard form, with a single spike set to project from the back of the scythe blade. The second reversed the scythe blade so as to have its concave cutting edge face toward the opponent, the blade being more curved and sickle like, and a spike tipping the pole end or projecting from the scythe blade.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla there is no fauchard fork skill of its own: such a weapon is fought with the skill of the kind of weapon it is. Look at it to see which (see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
